WEBVTT

00:06:59.407 --> 00:07:00.683
not in a commodity sense,

00:07:00.707 --> 00:07:03.476
but an appliance, mobile power,
mobile platform

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:06.115
for information and computing
and communication,

00:07:06.139 --> 00:07:08.476
as well as a form of transportation.

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:11.127
And the key to all of this
is to make it affordable,

00:07:11.151 --> 00:07:12.302
to make it exciting,

00:07:12.326 --> 00:07:15.467
to get it on a pathway where
there's a way to make money doing it.

00:07:15.491 --> 00:07:18.476
And again, this is a pretty
big march to take here.

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:19.653
A lot of people say:

00:07:19.677 --> 00:07:20.871
How do you sleep at night

00:07:20.895 --> 00:07:23.514
when you're wrestling with a problem
of that magnitude?

00:07:23.538 --> 00:07:26.702
I tell them I sleep like a baby:
I wake up crying every two hours.

00:07:26.726 --> 00:07:27.869
(Laughter)

00:07:27.893 --> 00:07:30.191
Actually, the theme
of this conference, I think,